# Waitlist endpoint — the Google Apps Script web app URL.
#
# Deliberately NOT in src/config.ts: Vuk edits that file directly and must not
# be able to break the endpoint. See CLAUDE.md rule 12.
#
# Deploy the script as a Web App with "Execute as: Me" and
# "Who has access: Anyone". Every code change needs a NEW deployment version.
#
# While this is unset the waitlist form runs in PREVIEW MODE: it validates,
# shows all three states, and sends nothing. It logs a console warning saying so.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=
